<#-- Signing guidance: sign and upload a scan first, and only post the hardcopies when the NSTA asks -->
<#macro signingInstructions>
  <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>Print two copies of the deed and sign both.</li>
    <li>Scan the signed deed and upload it in LMS.</li>
    <li>Do not post the hardcopies yet. The NSTA will check your scan and ask you to post the hardcopies once it is accepted.</li>
    <li>If the NSTA returns your signed deed, correct the issue it describes and upload the signed deed again.</li>
    <li>Make sure your scan is uploaded by the signing deadline.</li>
  </ul>
</#macro>
